Dear Iris,

I'm pleased to tell you that Council elected you a Fellow of the Institute at its meeting on 14 October, in recognition of fifteen years' practice at a senior level and your contribution to the profession's public understanding this year.

The certificate will be presented at the AGM in March. For now, please complete and return the attached acceptance form (Fellowship_Acceptance.pdf). The difference in subscription between Member and Fellow grade is waived for your first year.

Congratulations.

